# Generated graph-export artifacts — produced by export_graph.sh / export_tag_edges.py.
#
# These files contain REAL library content: canonical_name, description, Wikidata
# qid / wikidataUrl, and category names. QIDs in particular are library content that
# the private-terms commit hook does NOT catch (see CLAUDE.md). This repository is
# public. NEVER commit these.
#
# `scripts/graph/` is a tracked directory, so this .gitignore keeps the export output
# un-stageable even when someone runs `git add scripts/graph/`.
*.jsonl
*.csv

# Explicit names (belt and suspenders — the generated set):
entities.jsonl
wikidata_stubs.jsonl
category_edges.jsonl
cooccurs.csv
semantic_edges.csv
